graph TD
    User([Nguoi dung]) -->|Gui cau hoi| API[FastAPI Endpoint /chat]
    API --> Guard{Guard Agent}
    
    Guard -->|Khong hop le| Reject[Tu choi: Xin loi toi chi la...]
    Guard -->|Hop le| Router[Router / Analyzer]
    
    Router -->|Phan tich Intent| Agents{Spawn Agents}
    
    subgraph Expert_Agents [Cac Agent Chuyen gia]
        Career[Career Agent]
        Love[Love Agent]
        Health[Health Agent]
        Daily[Daily Agent]
        Personality[Personality Agent]
    end
    
    Agents --> Career
    Agents --> Love
    Agents --> Health
    Agents --> Daily
    Agents --> Personality
    
    Career --> Fusion[Fusion Agent]
    Love --> Fusion
    Health --> Fusion
    Daily --> Fusion
    Personality --> Fusion
    
    Fusion -->|Gop cau tra loi| API
    API -->|Tra ve Markdown| User
    
    style User fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style API fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Guard fill:#fbb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Router fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Fusion fill:#fdb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
